OL,3,GNEWSAPeople stuck in airport corridor
OL,4,Aas shuttle stops
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people have been stuck in a
OL,7,Fcorridor at Stansted Airport after a
OL,8,Fshuttle service for arriving passengers
OL,9,Fceased operating.
OL,11,FElaine Rollings, who landed at the
OL,12,FEssex terminal on Friday afternoon from
OL,13,FTenerife, said she and about 1,000
OL,14,Fpeople had been waiting for more than
OL,15,F90 minutes.
OL,17,F"More planes are arriving and feeding
OL,18,Finto this corridor, getting fuller and
OL,19,Ffuller," said the 60-year-old, speaking
OL,20,Fto the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
