OL,3,GNEWSAPeople stuck in airport corridor
OL,4,Aas shuttle stops
OL,5,
OL,6,FStansted Airport said the transit
OL,7,Fsystem was not in operation between
OL,8,Fmidday and 18:00 BST, but alternative
OL,9,Fcoaches had been laid on.
